    "detailed_description": "<strong>Project Chameleon is a stealth game where you must shape-shift into objects to go unnoticed by your enemies. Play as Siren, an elite spy executing missions around the globe. Manipulate your surroundings, set traps, and use powerful gadgets in each mission.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/fdb2eb54d72b9af4448759b48620d22c.poster.avif?t=1754522210\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/fdb2eb54d72b9af4448759b48620d22c.webm?t=1754522210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/fdb2eb54d72b9af4448759b48620d22c.mp4?t=1754522210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/7bc6a08bb6c581667cf7945c338745d6.avif?t=1754522210\" width=573 height=126 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/ad3b5ae06189896303886d44d271311e.poster.avif?t=1754522210\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/ad3b5ae06189896303886d44d271311e.webm?t=1754522210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/ad3b5ae06189896303886d44d271311e.mp4?t=1754522210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use your powerful suit to transform into different objects. Carefully choose the objects you transform into because the suit needs to recharge after use!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/2ef7b138a4aedec3807ea2cf2450d445.avif?t=1754522210\" width=600 height=126 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/78b36975d5e619bf4512b4a6334e9242.poster.avif?t=1754522210\" width=600 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/78b36975d5e619bf4512b4a6334e9242.webm?t=1754522210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/78b36975d5e619bf4512b4a6334e9242.mp4?t=1754522210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Some objects have unique utilities that can be used to manipulate the environment. Use a sophisticated hacking system, lure guards with sound-emitting objects, and more. Use these additional abilities to tackle more complex challenges!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/fdf871551a31da596ad4b59cceeb67d1.avif?t=1754522210\" width=600 height=126 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/a6a52fe0cf53dcb0dc33195be3a49c9c.poster.avif?t=1754522210\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/a6a52fe0cf53dcb0dc33195be3a49c9c.webm?t=1754522210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/a6a52fe0cf53dcb0dc33195be3a49c9c.mp4?t=1754522210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Find advanced gadgets and various items in each scenario. Use them to help Siren in her missions!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/2fdb312556e7ccb742bd8f8a988f6f87.avif?t=1754522210\" width=600 height=126 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/b65e0bbbfc4c61190f0afa32686b8a62.poster.avif?t=1754522210\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/b65e0bbbfc4c61190f0afa32686b8a62.webm?t=1754522210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/b65e0bbbfc4c61190f0afa32686b8a62.mp4?t=1754522210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Transform into various objects and blend into the environment to remain unseen.<br></li><li>Manipulate the environment with diverse abilities from special objects.<br></li><li>Use advanced gadgets and various items in each chapter.<br></li><li>Face eccentric and challenging missions while traveling through various countries around the world.<br></li><li>Over 80 levels divided into chapters, with unique settings, enemies, and mechanics.</li></ul>",
